sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ticker as GameLoop
    participant Update as Active Systems
    participant Scene as Scene Snapshot
    participant UI as Avalonia Render
    participant Skia as Skia Draw Operation
    participant Metrics as Performance Overlay

    Ticker->>Ticker: Wait for target frame interval
    Ticker->>Ticker: Calculate delta time
    Ticker->>Update: Update simulation systems
    Update-->>Ticker: Updated particles, transitions, parallax
    Ticker->>Scene: Capture immutable snapshot
    Scene-->>Ticker: Snapshot ready
    Ticker->>UI: Invalidate visual
    UI->>Skia: Execute custom draw operation
    Skia-->>UI: Frame rendered
    Ticker->>Metrics: Record update ms, render ms, FPS

    alt Frame over budget
        Metrics->>Ticker: Mark slow frame
        Ticker->>Ticker: Reduce optional effects if needed
    else Frame healthy
        Metrics->>Ticker: Keep target preset
    end
